# Keep the build context to what the image actually needs.
#
# historical/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the warm transcript cache under
# historical/.cache is baked into the image so containers never pay extraction
# cost on a customer request, and boot refuses to start without it.
#
# Everything below is either secret, client material the image has no use for,
# or bulk that would be uploaded to the build service for nothing.

# Secrets — must never reach a build context.
.env
.env.*
*-service-account*.json

# Client material the runtime does not read.
tmp/
edr_source/
output/
historical_excluded/

# Local build and scratch artifacts.
.git
.gitignore
*.exe
*.exe~
scratch/
docs/
